---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ModeChange from '../components/mode-change.astro';
import ImageFlipCard from '../components/ImageFlipCard.astro';
import FlipCard from '../components/FlipCard.astro';
import MiniLight from '../assets/mini-me-dark.png';
import MiniDark from '../assets/mini-me-light.png';
import AngryMiniLight from '../assets/mini-annoyed-dark.png';
import AngryMiniDark from '../assets/mini-annoyed-light.png';
import FrontImage from '../assets/front-image.jpeg';
import BackImage from '../assets/back-image.jpg';

import baking1 from '../photo-stories/baking/cookies.jpeg';
import baking2 from '../photo-stories/baking/pizza-rolls.jpeg';
import baking3 from '../photo-stories/baking/bread.jpeg';
import baking4 from '../photo-stories/baking/brownies.jpeg';
import baking5 from '../photo-stories/baking/cupcakes2.jpeg';

import paint1 from '../photo-stories/paint/boat.jpeg';
import paint2 from '../photo-stories/paint/gryphon.jpeg';
import paint3 from '../photo-stories/paint/umbrella.jpeg';
import paint4 from '../photo-stories/paint/siren.jpeg';
import paint5 from '../photo-stories/paint/otter.jpeg';

---

<Layout
  title="Projects & Interests — Teodora Piel"
  description="Projects, side work and interests — Python, machine learning, Astro, TypeScript, and everything outside the screen."
>
  <!-- Section 1: grows with its content -->
<!-- <div class="lg:border-x-[15vw] lg:border-[#efd0b4] dark:border-[#1a3721] lg:w-full"> -->

  <div class="relative bg-[#ffffff] dark:bg-[#000000] ">
	<ModeChange />

	<p class="absolute text-[#343434] pt-[4vw] left-[5vw] dark:text-[#cccccc] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto">
		<a
			href={"/"}
			class="inline-block px-[3vw] py-[1vw] border border-black text-black dark:border-[#cccccc] dark:text-white z-0 hover:text-[#ab3c00] dark:hover:text-[#7d7d7d] dark:hover:border-[#aaaaaa] hover:scale-110 text-[23px]">
			Home
		</a>
	</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center pt-12 pb-16">
		<h1 class="mt-25  px-[10vw] text-[23px] text-left text-[#222222] dark:text-[#cccccc] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto lg:px-[8vw]">
			Here you will find my projects, hobbies and interests.<br />
			Swipe through the cards to explore my work and click to learn more.
      	</h1>
	</div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative bg-[#fff4e6] dark:bg-[#222222] pb-[12vw] md:pb-[8vw]">

	<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-[6vw]">

		<!-- image -->
		<div class="group relative w-35 sm:w-50 md:w-50 lg:w-50 shrink-0 sm:translate-y-[4vw] translate-y-[6vw]">
			<div class="peer absolute inset-x-1/4 inset-y-1/4 z-10"></div>

			<img src={MiniLight.src} alt="Miniature version of me" class="w-full block dark:hidden peer-hover:hidden" />
			<img src={MiniDark.src} alt="Miniature version of me in dark mode" class="w-full hidden dark:block dark:peer-hover:hidden" />
			<img src={AngryMiniLight.src} alt="Angry miniature version of me" class="w-full hidden peer-hover:block dark:peer-hover:hidden" />
			<img src={AngryMiniDark.src} alt="Angry miniature version of me in dark mode" class="w-full hidden dark:peer-hover:block" />
		</div>

	<div class="w-40 sm:w-50 md:w-52 pt-7">
	<ImageFlipCard front={FrontImage} back={BackImage} class="aspect-3/4" />
	</div>
	</div>

<!-- Section 2: card deck -->
	<h2 class="font-sans text-[35px] pt-20 pl-[8vw] text-[#160066] dark:text-[#ffffff] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto lg:px-[8vw]">
		Projects & Interests
	</h2>

	<!-- deck: flex row, overlapping, centered -->
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-6
            md:grid-cols-[repeat(6,clamp(80px,11vw,140px))] md:justify-center md:gap-0
            mt-[6vw] md:mt-[3vw] mx-auto">

		<!-- top of pile (leftmost) -->

		<div class="relative z-70 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Coding" text="Only took up coding recently, but it opened a world of possibilities."
				color="#FFF0DB" darkColor="#282224">
				<div slot="back"><p>Learning how to code, has meant relearning to love solving complex problems with nothing but a computer and curiosity.<br />
					</p>
					<div class="center pt-[2vw]">
						<a
							href={"/explore-reasoning"}
							class="inline-block px-[2vw] py-[0.5vw] border border-black text-black dark:border-[#cccccc] dark:text-[#65c0c6] z-0 hover:text-[#ab3c00] dark:hover:text-[#00eaff] dark:hover:border-white hover:scale-110 text-[20px]">
							Explore Reasoning
						</a>					
					</div>
				</div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-60 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Sports" text="Now on hold. But there is a variety I am pationate about."
				color="#fff5e6" titleColor="#160066">
				<div slot="back"><p>I enjoy a variety of sports, but only as a hobby. One of my favorite sports is ice skating. </p></div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-50 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Painting" text="Where there is free time, there is art."
				color="#FFEFD5" darkColor="#34282C"				  
				backImages={[
								{ image: paint1},
								{ image: paint2},
								{ image: paint3},
								{ image: paint4},
								{ image: paint5},]}>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-40 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Creative Writing" text="Exploring fantastical stories and narratives."
				color="#F7E7CE" darkColor="#3B3131">
				<div slot="back"><p>Writing stories falls short in most cases due to the lack of time, but I do enjoy it.</p></div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-30 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Baking" text="Creating delicious treats and breads. Chemistry in the kitchen."
				color="#FFEBCD" darkColor="#343434" 
				  backImages={[
								{ image: baking1, caption: "Cookies" },
								{ image: baking2, caption: "Pizza-Rolls" },
								{ image: baking3, caption: "Bread" },
								{ image: baking4, caption: "Brownies" },
								{ image: baking5, caption: "Cupcakes" },
							]}>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>


		<div class="relative z-20 transition-all duration-200 hover:z-100 hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Video Games and Books" text="There is a variety of worlds to explore."
				color="#fff1e6" darkColor="#404042">
				<div slot="back"><p>Writing a little game in my free time, that should be an interesting project!</p></div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>

	</div>
  </div>

</Layout>

---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ModeChange from '../components/mode-change.astro';
import FlipCard from '../components/FlipCard.astro';


---
<Layout
  title="Why Software Development — Teodora Piel"
  description="Why I moved from chemistry into software development, and what I'm building along the way."
>
  <!-- Section 1: grows with its content -->
<!-- <div class="lg:border-x-[15vw] lg:border-[#efd0b4] dark:border-[#1a3721] lg:w-full"> -->

  <div class="relative bg-[#ffffff] dark:bg-[#000000] ">
	<ModeChange />

	<p class="absolute text-[#343434] pt-[4vw] left-[5vw] dark:text-[#cccccc] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto">
		<a
			href={"/"}
			class="inline-block px-[3vw] py-[1vw] border border-black text-black dark:border-[#cccccc] dark:text-white z-0 hover:text-[#ab3c00] dark:hover:text-[#7d7d7d] dark:hover:border-[#aaaaaa] hover:scale-110 text-[23px]">
			Home
		</a>
	</p>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center pt-12 pb-16">
		<h1 class="mt-25  px-[10vw] text-[23px] text-left text-[#222222] dark:text-[#cccccc] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto lg:px-[8vw]">
			This is meant to give you a glimpse into my mind, my thoughts and my decisions.
			Click on the cards to learn more.
      	</h1>
	</div>
  </div>

<!-- Section 2: card deck -->
<div class="relative py-[10vw] lg:py-[6vw] bg-[#fff4e6] dark:bg-[#222222]">
	<h2 class="font-sans text-[35px] pl-[8vw] text-[#160066] dark:text-[#ffffff] lg:max-w-[70vw] lg:mx-auto lg:px-[8vw]">
		Thoughts and Reasoning
	</h2>

	<!-- deck: flex row, overlapping, centered -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-[20px] gap-y-[40px] max-w-[860px] mx-auto pt-20 px-4">
  <div class="w-full max-w-[400px] relative z-[70] transition-all duration-200 hover:z-[100] md:hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title=" Pursuit of Software Development"
				color="#FFF0DB" darkColor="#282224" darkTitleColor="#ffffff" size="w-full max-w-[400px] h-[880px] min-[380px]:h-[780px] min-[440px]:h-[600px]">
				<div slot="back">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                    <p>
                        I've wanted to learn coding for a long time, and during my master's program I finally seized
                        the chance to dive in properly.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Programming turned out to be a mix of logic and creativity. It makes it possible to tackle complex problems and watching the solution
                        take shape piece by piece. This is what makes programming addictive. That's what made the decision simple: finish my
                        degree in Chemistry, learn as much as I could along the way, and then move into
                        software development. My master's thesis surprised me by bringing both worlds together, and I came out of it stronger in each.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I'm early in that transition and still learning every day. Right now I'm looking for a
                        role where I can keep building in a professional environment.
                    </p>
                    </div>
				</div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>


		<div class="w-full max-w-[400px] relative z-[40] transition-all duration-200 hover:z-[100] md:hover:scale-[1.05]">
			<FlipCard title="Projects, Skills and Ideas"
				color="#FFF0DB" darkColor="#3B3131" darkTitleColor="#ffffff" size="w-full max-w-[400px] h-[880px] min-[380px]:h-[780px] min-[440px]:h-[600px]">
				<div slot="back">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                    <p>
                        During my time at university, I've worked on a number of projects. Some of those projects were part
                        of my studies, others personal.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I've used Python for data analysis and for automating
                        workflows during my studies, including supervised learning and plugin development.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        My personal projects include this website, built with Astro and Tailwind CSS, and
                        a small browser game in TypeScript. I've since decided that idea wasn't up to par,
                        so I'm starting over with a new one.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        For now I'm only scratching the surface of what programming can do, but I'm excited
                        to keep learning, find new challenges, and improve my skills.
                    </p>
                    </div>             
                </div>
			</FlipCard>
		</div>


	</div>
</div>
	</Layout>